keywords:
  - "AI agent authorization"
  - "task-bounded authority"
  - "least privilege"
  - "selection witnesses"
  - "agent security"
  - "AgentDojo"
abstract: >-
  Agent Authority is a task-bounded execution layer for AI agents. It narrows
  provider access to task-local effects and resources using explicit authority,
  evidence-derived facts, approvals, and provider-boundary enforcement. The
  repository includes reproducible AgentDojo and provider-boundary evaluations.
